			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> This is funny to me because I recently added a few images to the caniuse site and I only used webp 😅 Fairly comfortable with that given the audience.</p>",
