			},
			"date": "2023-11-15T23:30:54.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I have been advising to keep JPEG as the canonical copy and generate webp/avif from that since you can generate a JPEG XL version from it losslessly, unlike webp</p>",
