			"date": "2023-11-15T23:35:32.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> the secret true answer here is “it’s already the baseline because any website at CDN scale (Cloudflare, etc) is already likely automatically converting images to WebP if there’s a significant file size improvement” 😅</p>",
