			"date": "2023-11-16T04:06:13.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> it might be just slightly early, but i’d go with it, depending on the audience. if ~100% compatibility and/or support for older devices is a goal, perhaps offering a fallback to jpeg with a &lt;picture&gt; tag might cover it</p>",
