			},
			"date": "2023-11-17T07:51:02.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Really it's there same question as \"am I ok with this site only targeting modern browsers\". For a personal project, or something where the audience will be likely to have that then sure. If it's a business thing then so way. Of course the real answer is use a CDN or picture tag.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
