			},
			"date": "2023-11-23T20:17:40.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I use AVIF with WebP fallback. I think the more interesting debate is about the future of JXL:</p><p><a href=\"https://dev.to/jonarnes/get-ready-for-jpeg-xl-today-204j\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">dev.to/jonarnes/get-ready-for-</span><span class=\"invisible\">jpeg-xl-today-204j</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1178058#c84\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/i</span><span class=\"invisible\">ssues/detail?id=1178058#c84</span></a></p>",
